Subject: [PATCH] 0004: user impersonation via OIDC (SA token, scopes,
 email/groups) minus OIDC_VALIDATOR

---
 cmd/bridge/config/auth/authoptions.go | 24 ++++++++++++++-
 pkg/auth/oauth2/auth_oidc.go          | 15 +++++++++-
